<title>USA: Chase buys mortgage servicing rights.</title>
<headline>Chase buys mortgage servicing rights.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Manhattan Mortgage Corp said Wednesday it has agreed with Source One Mortgage Services Corp to acquire $19.3 billion of mortgage servicing rights.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed, the Chase Manhattan Corp subsidiary said. It is subject to due diligence, regulatory and agency approvals and is expected to close in January.</p>
<p>After the proposed transaction is completed, Chase noted, it will become the nation's second largest mortgage servicer.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
